{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Foreign-born residents",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of residents born outside the United States, pale green to deep blue. Measured over all 3,222 counties with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 1.25%/2%/4%/6.5%/12%, which fall at the 21st/37th/62nd/77th/91st percentile of the national distribution.",
